# A checked-in fixture for the `type` and `namespace` scopes: a namespace, a
# nested namespace, an aggregate, a nested struct, an enum, a typedef, an
# alias, a class template with STL protocol members, a class with out-of-line
# constructor and destructor, a namespace alias and a using-directive, all
# written against the Google style so that every one of them has to move --
# across three targets, so the spellings in a dependent's TU are reached
# through --owned-files, and with a dependent type name (`typename R::dims`)
# that only the instantiating TUs can resolve.  RUN_TESTS=1: shapes_test
# exercises the renamed code, not merely its compilation.
REPO_KIND=local
REPO_PATH=e2e/testdata/naming_repo
TARGET_PATTERN='//...'
RUN_TESTS=1
